    "detailed_description": "The Poisoned Roots is a short experience that takes around 30 minutes to an hour to finish. It has no save feature and is intended to be completed within a single play session. <br><br>The story is told through the environment as well as the various interactable objects within the game. There is minimal hand-holding and players must pay close attention to details in order to uncover the events that transpired. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435560/extras/c719430e7193991106cb9c2a8ba31e57.poster.avif?t=1628738955\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435560/extras/c719430e7193991106cb9c2a8ba31e57.webm?t=1628738955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435560/extras/c719430e7193991106cb9c2a8ba31e57.mp4?t=1628738955\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i>An experience that focuses on atmosphere and narrative over traditional gameplay</i><br></li><li><i>A rich, emotional story about the effects of abuse and obsession</i><br></li><li><i>A detailed environment that rewards the player\u2019s curiosity</i><br></li><li><i>An atmospheric Original Soundtrack</i></li></ul>",
